From 54178461e4cecb9ddaf6bf700387e42208ca5aba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 09:03:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(session-start): pin a closed toolset allowlist on a
 durable start for the whole session lineage [daveey]

StartIntent.toolsets (validated, known concrete names, never all/*) is stored in
session_start_requests.toolsets_json and part of the idempotency digest. _make_agent
resolves the pin through parent_session_id (compression, branch, reopen) and builds the
agent with exactly that list; reload/refresh paths cannot widen it. A failed lookup
refuses the build. Absent allowlist is unchanged.
